#ASSERT NOT (`trust indenture within s 82(1)` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`trust indenture within s 82(1)` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE)
-- args: appointed as trustee under the terms of a trust indenture to which a corporation is a party; a successor trustee
